From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ArnoldasMk <arnoldas.kanobi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: expand Smart Pixels controls

Port the extra SmartPiXelsPosed controls into the native LieppOS/SystemUI
Smart Pixels implementation: transparent-pixel dim amount, system-bars alpha,
and burn-in-protection pattern shifting. The system-bars alpha control uses a
trusted overlay over status/navigation-bar insets so it remains visible across
Android 16 status-bar implementations.

---
